# HTTP routes

The daemon's plain-HTTP (REST) surface: PTY sessions, artifacts, sandboxes,
actor spawn, and daemon status. The typed op surface (rules, pipelines, git,
…) is served over Connect instead — see the per-domain `Ops:` reference.
Parsed from the `@route` annotations in `apps/shipd/src/routes/mod.rs`, the
same registry `build.rs` compiles into the Rust router and the TS route
catalog, so this table cannot drift from what the daemon registers.

**Auth** — `scope <S>` routes are enforced against the named scope at the
router. `handler` routes compute the required scope dynamically (e.g. from an
artifact's stored scope) and enforce it inside the handler.

| Method | Path | Auth | Body | Returns |
|--------|------|------|------|---------|
| `POST` | `/api/v1/session` | scope `Full` | — | `SessionIssueResponse` |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/ship/schema` | scope `ReadWorkspace` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/sessions/spawn` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/pty-sessions` | scope `ReadRuns` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}` | scope `ReadRuns` | — | — |
| `DELETE` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}/input` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}/resize` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}/message` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}/reply` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}/stream` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/sessions/{id}/events` | scope `ReadRuns` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/harnesses/installed` | scope `ReadWorkspace` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/daemon/status` | scope `ReadWorkspace` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/projects/{id}/pty` | scope `ManageRuns` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/actor/spawn` | scope `MeshSend` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/actors` | scope `ReadWorkspace` | — | — |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/artifacts` | handler | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/artifacts/{id}` | handler | — | — |
| `HEAD` | `/api/v1/artifacts/{id}` | handler | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/artifacts/{id}/metadata` | handler | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/sandboxes` | scope `ReadWorkspace` | — | — |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/sandboxes/{id}` | scope `ReadWorkspace` | — | — |
